rsity. Reserved category candidates will get a 5% relaxation in minimum qualifying marks as per rules.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. How to Apply For UP Banda ECCE Educator Bharti 2026?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong> Candidates can submit their applications through the official recruitment link provided on the official Sarkari Result™ website, SarkariResult.com.cm (Since 2009).</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is UP Rojgar Sangam (Sewayojan) Portal Official Website?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The Official Website of UP Rojgar Sangam (Sewayojan) Portal is https://sewayojan.up.nic.in/</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
